  (text "ALL-IN-ONE AUDIO INTERFACE - schematic rev A (generated by hardware/schematic/design.py)\nUSB-C UAC2 (XMOS XU316) | PCM1794A DAC | headphone amp >= 2 W @ 32R (OPA1612 + 2x LME49600 per ch)\nXLR mic input: THAT1512 preamp 0-60 dB, switchable +48 V phantom, CS5361 ADC\nNets are joined by labels: global labels across sheets, local labels within a sheet.\nSee docs/design.md for the full description and the list of items to verify before layout."
    (at 30 130 0)
